msgctxt "108"
msgid "Majima's over in <Color:7>Purgatory<Color:Default> like always."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"Way in hasn't changed either. It's still just the "
"<Color:7>bathroom<Color:Default>\r\n"
"in the park."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "And Kiryu? Promise me you won't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Have to say, I never thought Majima would be mixed up in all\r\n"
"this. Even with his reputation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Not sure if he's the one leading the charge, but he's\r\n"
"definitely involved. You think maybe he shot Daigo and\r\n"
"Kashiwagi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "No. There's no chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Look, Kiryu. I know you two are pals and all, but a yakuza\r\n"
"who's your friend is still a yakuza. And Majima especially.\r\n"
"Let that dog off his leash and who knows what'll happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "You're wrong. Majima-san promised me he'd look after Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "And he's not the promise breaking type. I trust him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "I get how you feel, I really do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "But what if you're wrong? What if Majima really is behind all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "If that's the case..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Then I'll have no choice but to kill him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Kiryu..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "I'm gonna go talk to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Hold on, Kiryu! We don't know whose side he's on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "That's exactly why I need to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "I have a lot of questions, and Majima-san's going to answer them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Kiryu..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Is he still over in <Color:7>Purgatory<Color:Default>?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Yup, family headquarters hasn't moved an inch. Still looks\r\n"
"like nothing more than an empty lot, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Oh, and the way in's the same, too. Through the "
"<Color:7>bathroom<Color:Default> in\r\n"
"the park, just like always."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "And Kiryu? Promise me you won't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "I promise."
msgstr ""

